  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.1.1 is a backward-compatible maintenance release. Bug fixes: reject the libmem bad-address sentinel before VmtManager creates native VMT state; preserve VTable page protection when Unhook is called for an untracked index; add regression coverage for invalid VTable addresses and VMT lifecycle/protection contracts; improve NuGet publication and post-release smoke-test coverage. Compatibility: no intentional Public API changes from 2.1.0; the pinned rdbo/libmem revision is unchanged; the official target remains Windows x64 / .NET 8. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.1.1 是向后兼容的维护修复版本。Bug 修复：在 VmtManager 创建 native VMT 状态前拒绝 libmem bad-address sentinel；修复对未跟踪 index 调用 Unhook 时可能改变 VTable 页保护的问题；补充无效 VTable 地址及 VMT 生命周期/页保护回归测试；完善 NuGet 发布与发布后 smoke test 覆盖。兼容性：相比 2.1.0 不主动引入 Public API 变更；固定的 rdbo/libmem 版本不变；正式支持目标仍为 Windows x64 / .NET 8。 Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
